WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:13.013
Vinnie and Mandy stayed a while to watch Seiko's parents dye the fabrics.

2
00:00:13.014 --> 00:00:18.203
"I'll take you to Daimyo Masamune's home now," said Seiko.

3
00:00:18.204 --> 00:00:25.091
When they reached the daimyo's house, Seiko said good-bye at the front gate.

4
00:00:25.092 --> 00:00:27.028
"Thanks for everything,"

5
00:00:27.029 --> 00:00:30.443
said Vinnie, pointing to his sandals.

6
00:00:30.444 --> 00:00:34.059
"Come and visit again," said Seiko.

7
00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:37.207
Then she bowed and left.

8
00:00:37.208 --> 00:00:42.154
"Do you think Haruki will be looking for us?" asked Vinnie.

9
00:00:42.155 --> 00:00:46.917
"I hope he doesn't get in trouble," said Mandy.

10
00:00:46.918 --> 00:00:52.368
As they walked up to the house, the children heard metal clanging.

11
00:00:52.369 --> 00:00:56.780
The noise was coming from the other side of the house.

12
00:00:56.781 --> 00:01:00.435
"Let's have a look," said Vinnie.

13
00:01:00.436 --> 00:01:04.613
Sighing loudly, Mandy followed.

14
00:01:04.614 --> 00:01:10.394
The children came to a courtyard filled with samurai, old and young.

15
00:01:10.395 --> 00:01:14.386
Some were teaching; others were training.

16
00:01:14.387 --> 00:01:18.087
A few samurai practiced with swords.

17
00:01:18.088 --> 00:01:22.260
Another group was learning to use a bow and arrow.

18
00:01:22.261 --> 00:01:26.208
"There you are!" a familiar voice called out.

19
00:01:26.209 --> 00:01:28.091
It was Haruki.

20
00:01:28.092 --> 00:01:30.814
"I was looking everywhere for you."

21
00:01:30.815 --> 00:01:35.098
"We're sorry," the children apologized.

22
00:01:35.099 --> 00:01:38.668
Mandy explained what happened.

23
00:01:38.669 --> 00:01:42.147
Haruki bowed his head and said,

24
00:01:42.148 --> 00:01:44.215
"Thank you for coming back.

25
00:01:44.216 --> 00:01:48.245
Daimyo Masamune would have been very angry with me."

26
00:01:48.246 --> 00:01:53.844
The samurai suddenly stopped their training at the sound of horses.

27
00:01:53.845 --> 00:01:57.665
Daimyo Masamune had returned home.

28
00:01:57.666 --> 00:02:01.790
"Haruki, did you take good care of our guests?"

29
00:02:01.791 --> 00:02:04.460
he asked, approaching them.

30
00:02:04.461 --> 00:02:07.052
Haruki bowed his head.

31
00:02:07.053 --> 00:02:13.422
"We were watching the samurai training," said Vinnie enthusiastically.

32
00:02:13.423 --> 00:02:18.612
Daimyo Masamune motioned for Vinnie and Mandy to follow him.

33
00:02:18.613 --> 00:02:23.675
"A samurai's training is not only about weapons," he said.

34
00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:29.057
He took them to a smaller courtyard full of red maple trees.

35
00:02:29.058 --> 00:02:33.815
"It's beautiful!" cried Mandy.

36
00:02:33.816 --> 00:02:40.006
Then Daimyo Masamune led them into a room next to the courtyard.

37
00:02:40.007 --> 00:02:44.089
"Isn't this in the photo?" asked Vinnie.

38
00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:47.804
He took out the photo and looked at it.

39
00:02:47.805 --> 00:02:53.186
Daimyo Masamune stood in front of a vase on a small table.

40
00:02:53.187 --> 00:02:57.212
In the vase were three stems that formed a triangle.

41
00:02:57.213 --> 00:02:59.354
Two were flowers.

42
00:02:59.355 --> 00:03:03.735
He gently picked up a flower lying on the table.

43
00:03:03.736 --> 00:03:06.941
"A true warrior must have perfect control,"

44
00:03:06.942 --> 00:03:10.484
he said, putting the flower in the vase.

45
00:03:10.485 --> 00:03:13.845
"We must have peace in our heart."

46
00:03:13.846 --> 00:03:18.820
Then Daimyo Masamune picked up a pine stem.

47
00:03:18.821 --> 00:03:24.105
"Mandy, the photo is glowing blue!" Vinnie whispered.

48
00:03:24.106 --> 00:03:29.341
Daimyo Masamune's flower arrangement was very lovely.

49
00:03:29.342 --> 00:03:32.477
He pointed to one flower and said,

50
00:03:32.478 --> 00:03:35.550
"This stands for the sacred mountain."

51
00:03:35.551 --> 00:03:37.984
Pointing to another, he said,

52
00:03:37.985 --> 00:03:40.663
"And this is the river."

53
00:03:40.664 --> 00:03:44.539
Then he pointed to a white flower in the middle.

54
00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:48.646
"And this is the mist that unites the river and the mountain.

55
00:03:48.647 --> 00:03:50.971
Nature is one."

56
00:03:50.972 --> 00:03:54.406
Daimyo Masamune closed his eyes.

57
00:03:54.407 --> 00:03:58.360
The flower arrangement in the photo glowed red.

58
00:03:58.361 --> 00:04:00.341
"We're going home,"

59
00:04:00.342 --> 00:04:05.598
whispered Vinnie, grabbing his sister's hand.

60
00:04:05.599 --> 00:04:15.647
The children fell down the tunnel and were back in the attic.
